  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Economic Crimes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assist government in drafting Anti-Money Laundering/Counter-Terrorist Financing (AML/CFT) legislative framework that is compliant with international standards. Support implementation of risk based AML/CFT supervision of financial institutions and financial intermediaries. Assist in regulation and supervision of bank and non-bank financial institutions, including development of off- and on-site examination policies and procedures. Assist government in increasing capacity to investigate and prosecute money laundering, terrorist financing, corruption, and customs offences. Lead implementation of a regional law enforcement working group to increase information sharing and coordination and enhance prosecution of money laundering and asset forfeiture.</narrative>
  </description>
